OL,3,CThe cocktails, 'exam revision' and
OL,4,Cjubilation at Rory's hometown club
OL,6,FAt the Clubhouse, Sullivan Upper
OL,7,FSchool, where McIlroy studied, was
OL,8,Frepresented among those cheering on.
OL,10,FZach Woods, 19, said he and his
OL,11,Ffriends thought the victory was
OL,12,F"really inspiring".
OL,14,FHe said: "It is great to be honest, to
OL,15,Fsee a boy from our community achieve
OL,16,Fsuch great things.
OL,18,F"It pushes us to strive to do the best
OL,19,Fthat we can to achieve the things that
OL,20,Fwe love."
OL,26,@tD@AOUtD@RO]vD@JOUzD@AOU|D@IO]
